  "description": "Kingbright 1.6 x 1.6 x 0.7 mm full-colour SMD LED: Hyper Red (AlGaInP, 621 nm), Green (InGaN, 525 nm) and Blue (InGaN, 465 nm) chips under a water clear lens, 130 deg viewing angle, common anode on pin 1 and cathodes on pins 2 (Red), 3 (Green), 4 (Blue). At 2 mA: VF 1.8 / 2.65 / 2.65 V typ (2.1 / 3.1 / 3.1 max), 15 / 80 / 14 mcd typ. DC forward current 30 / 25 / 30 mA max. -40 to +85 C. 4 castellated pads, MSL 3, 2000 per reel.",
